  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen Women in Leadership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Tanzania Media Women&apos;s Association (TAMWA) Zanzibar, to strengthen women in leadership (SWIL).The expected impact is women regarded as active and vibrant actors in democratic prosesses. The expected outcome is increased demand for democratic and political rights by women in Zanzibar.</narrative>
  </description>
